Add Zebra ZP 450 driver entries

The ZP 450 is a rebadged Zebra GK420d: 203dpi, 4-inch, direct thermal.
Base units ship with EPL2 firmware; dual-firmware units also speak ZPL II.
Upstream LPrint has no ZP 450 entry, so autoadd falls back to the generic
"COMMAND SET:EPL;" driver and the model is never named in the UI.

These entries are strictly additive: they match on COMMAND SET + MODEL, so a
ZP 450 reporting a different MODEL string simply scores 0 and falls back to the
generic driver exactly as before.

--- a/lprint-epl2.h	2026-08-19 21:15:45.478116492 +0000
+++ b/lprint-epl2.h	2026-08-19 21:15:45.550595999 +0000
@@ -17,6 +17,8 @@
   "", NULL },
 { "epl2_4inch-203dpi-dt",        "Zebra EPL Page Mode 4-inch/203dpi/Direct-Thermal",
   "COMMAND SET:EPL;", NULL },
+{ "epl2_4inch-203dpi-dt_zp450",   "Zebra ZP 450 (EPL)",
+  "COMMAND SET:EPL;MODEL:ZTC ZP 450;", NULL },
 { "epl2_4inch-203dpi-tt",        "Zebra EPL Page Mode 4-inch/203dpi/Thermal-Transfer",
   "", NULL },
 { "epl2_4inch-300dpi-dt",        "Zebra EPL Page Mode 4-inch/300dpi/Direct-Thermal",
--- a/lprint-zpl.h	2026-08-19 21:15:45.482116492 +0000
